  "details": "<p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://whc.unesco.org/en/list/1348/\">Inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site</a>\u00a0in 2011 as part of the \"Ancient Villages of Northern Syria\" under criteria iii, iv, and v of UNESCO's World Heritage List\u00a0<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://whc.unesco.org/en/criteria/\">Operational Guidelines</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Specific archaeological components include:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A 4th century AD <strong>basilica</strong>, which is among the oldest churches in Syria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>",
